# The source distribution is the installable library plus its top-level documents.
#
# The test suite is deliberately left out. Roughly half of it replays committed
# benchmark records, which live under benchmarks/ (about 140 MB) and are checked
# against Git history, so it runs from a clone of the repository, not from an
# unpacked sdist. Shipping tests that cannot run there would only mislead.
prune tests
include ARCHITECTURE.md
include CHANGELOG.md
include CITATION.cff
include CONVENTIONS.md
